{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "56a966c480d685feda80ee7078fba9acd9e515f874f45a6390f1325b9d7ff14f", "ja": "（アイドルサマーフェスティバルの書類はこれでよし。\n……最近、大きな仕事が続いてるせいか寝不足だな）", "zh": "（偶像夏日祭的文件这样就处理完了。\n……是因为最近工作很重的缘故吗，感觉睡不够。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7ab2208fb0df2a3101612f5bbbe271949964d2712dc40ea6229a9c69c86cdf0a", "ja": "ふわぁ～……。", "zh": "呼哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "bdd4b8b44406b9e05cdf123addb2451a2e4e307de8512e1da397ce571ec1b5ad", "ja": "わぁ……。\n{$P$}、大きなあくびだねぇ。", "zh": "哇……\n{$P$}，好大一个哈欠呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1003_p", "source_sha256": "27bffe1f356ed8cdb2c27fd660ed09fda004b270819154277197a8dc2efda0bd", "ja": "えっ？　わっ、ひなた！　いたのか……。\nはは、気の抜けたところ見せちゃったな。", "zh": "咦？哇，日向！原来你在啊……\n哈哈，被你看到我松懈的一面了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "1fe7b01d4db018835556b795c4ea75278039ee88c1fdcff54a10b644af46d8ec", "ja": "ううん、なんもなんも。\nあたしこそ、笑ったりしちゃって、ごめんねぇ。", "zh": "没事，这不算什么。\n我才要道歉，不好意思刚才笑你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "bfc53516f485a0463f9fbdb5b7c0ae839b82c4caedcdb967e20ce6e2d2530687", "ja": "なんだか、弟のことを思い出してしまったんだわ。\n{$P$}は、大人なのにねぇ。", "zh": "不经意地就想起我弟弟了哪。\n明明{$P$}已经是大人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ef788b7d65192b4953c2f3db0416d0e89ef91742a0f55a3bce635282b6991f49", "ja": "弟か……はは。でも、お姉さんっていうのは\nそういうものなのかもしれないな。", "zh": "弟弟啊……哈哈。\n不过，所谓的姊姊或许就是会这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "fd15dad0366ebd727ecb23c17315119f407920b557638faee9b22bf5725340bf", "ja": "したっけ、ちょっとお姉さんぶってしまうけども……\n{$P$}、無理してないかい？", "zh": "那我就来装个姊姊的样子好了……\n{$P$}，你是不是太勉强自己了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "d27940e210d980e3045699f4a742b1977242d0adbae237c639eacae5af05b3d3", "ja": "最近、ずっと疲れてるみたいだから……\nあたし、ちょっこし心配だべさ。", "zh": "看你最近都很疲惫……\n我有点担心哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4953418be169bc43dcc3d45ba7bec19cc72ab82f4de9c3395b1971d9f3e1e316", "ja": "ひなたにまで気づかれちゃってたのか……。\n大丈夫、少し寝不足なだけで、ちゃんと休んでるよ。", "zh": "居然连日向都发现了……别担心，\n我只是有点睡眠不足，但还是有在休息的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "9696b31142689d18139fa6726bd3ea3a42a4997818486b19c95ec22a2e6b8d87", "ja": "そうかい？　それならいいんだけども……。\nあたしもなんか、力になれんもんかねぇ？", "zh": "是吗？有在休息就好……\n有没有什么是我帮得上忙的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "8520fb724cc9ddfa8092200354760440b8eecdedb9d5a98a026690b3a4f75624", "ja": "う～ん……あっ、そうだ！　{$P$}、\nちょっこし待っててくれるかい？　すぐ戻るからねぇ！", "zh": "嗯……啊，有了！{$P$}，\n你可以等我一下吗？我马上回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cde5ed3fb10e4624b63e4153cbdc419498bda3187f487ab45728d32c082c6256", "ja": "ひなた……っと、行ってしまったか。\nなんだろう？", "zh": "日向……走掉了啊。\n她要做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "13fbf398fa85db1fd91769b64d84ce2fc94485ed5b9cea4d661bffbdd124c8b5", "ja": "お待たせ、{$P$}。\nお茶を淹れてきたよぉ。それと……えへへ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，久等了。\n我去泡了茶喔，还有……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "cc17768c13735a6681096d96714a229457fd192f2e1ab746794e57be661bd8fa", "ja": "実家から届いたお漬物、切ってきたべさ！\nみんなへの差し入れにと思って、持ってきてたんだわ。", "zh": "我去切了老家寄过来的腌渍物哪！\n我想说要慰劳大家，就带过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "b14fc6b5af0386b747dfa1ca0c4a4c1ced756ec39060a444a0aada1db131c5cd", "ja": "お漬物とお茶で、元気出してねぇ。", "zh": "吃点腌渍物喝点茶，恢复活力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ed475fa18d031c0fb719796032dfa0a7a2992f6c8354697c54469232af5e1531", "ja": "おお、美味しそうだな！　ありがとう、ひなた。\n……うん、なんだか落ち着くな……。", "zh": "喔喔，看起来真好吃！日向，谢谢你。\n……嗯，感觉真平静……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0073_1017_p", "source_sha256": "44957447c9551798eccbf3374baced85bdeb3d420e368954ac03402fbf4c1375", "ja": "（温かいお茶と、ひなたの心遣いとで、元気が出たな。\n……うん、まだまだ頑張れそうだ！）", "zh": "（暖人的热茶跟日向的体贴让我恢复活力了。\n……嗯，应该还能再加把劲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
